    "name": "Perfect Teams",
    "steam_appid": 2620530,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620530/extras/13281e53a0504b4f1dcf5678859764cb.avif?t=1729274423\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br><br>Universes have been merged ! This fusion is unstable, each game will be different and new enemies and challenges will await you. You will have to recruit and create a team with heroes from various universes and combine their exclusive cards and powers. What will be your perfect team ?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620530/extras/0cdfa9044f0d4f9c80d81e07783ab706.avif?t=1729274423\" width=300 height=300 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><i>Unique characters</i> : <strong>Each character is unique</strong> and owns unique cards, equipments and abilities. It will be primordial to choose wisely your team to defeat the threats to your wolrds.<br><br><i>Unstable universe</i> : Each game, <strong>the path to your enemy will be different</strong>. Fight powerful enemies, find random events, gather new equipments, it's up to you to choose the path to victory.<br><br><i>Innovative gameplay</i> : In Perfect Teams, the cards you play are important but <strong>the order is event more important</strong> ! Many cards have a combo effect which triggers when the previous played card is the right color and adds powerful effects to the base card.<br><br><i>Improve your team</i> : After each game, you will <strong>unlock new characters</strong>, new equipments and improve your team.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620530/extras/1a0d0bceaf8231dffe6a4d28c1049fb1.avif?t=1729274423\" width=300 height=300 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>18 unique characters to combine<br></li><li>250+ cards<br></li><li>200+ equipments which will alter your gameplay<br></li><li>100+ different fights<br></li><li>50+ random events<br></li><li>861 team combinations, which will be yours ?</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620530/extras/3839da96817bb94df89aea017a447368.avif?t=1729274423\" width=300 height=300 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620530/extras/13281e53a0504b4f1dcf5678859764cb.avif?t=1729274423\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br><br>Universes have been merged ! This fusion is unstable, each game will be different and new enemies and challenges will await you. You will have to recruit and create a team with heroes from various universes and combine their exclusive cards and powers. What will be your perfect team ?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620530/extras/0cdfa9044f0d4f9c80d81e07783ab706.avif?t=1729274423\" width=300 height=300 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><i>Unique characters</i> : <strong>Each character is unique</strong> and owns unique cards, equipments and abilities. It will be primordial to choose wisely your team to defeat the threats to your wolrds.<br><br><i>Unstable universe</i> : Each game, <strong>the path to your enemy will be different</strong>. Fight powerful enemies, find random events, gather new equipments, it's up to you to choose the path to victory.<br><br><i>Innovative gameplay</i> : In Perfect Teams, the cards you play are important but <strong>the order is event more important</strong> ! Many cards have a combo effect which triggers when the previous played card is the right color and adds powerful effects to the base card.<br><br><i>Improve your team</i> : After each game, you will <strong>unlock new characters</strong>, new equipments and improve your team.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620530/extras/1a0d0bceaf8231dffe6a4d28c1049fb1.avif?t=1729274423\" width=300 height=300 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>18 unique characters to combine<br></li><li>250+ cards<br></li><li>200+ equipments which will alter your gameplay<br></li><li>100+ different fights<br></li><li>50+ random events<br></li><li>861 team combinations, which will be yours ?</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620530/extras/3839da96817bb94df89aea017a447368.avif?t=1729274423\" width=300 height=300 /></span>",
